1. Patient

A patient comes to the behavioral-health/addiction-treatment facility for help with Alcohol Use Disorder.

The patient is registered in BestNotes.

Patient
 ├── Patient ID
 ├── Name
 ├── DOB
 ├── Gender
 └── Contact information

FHIR:

Patient

This becomes the central patient reference for many other resources.

For example:

"subject": {
    "reference": "Patient/12345"
}
